{
  "SUPERSEDED": {
    "status": "SUPERSEDED - RETRACTED",
    "retractedBy": "docs/experiments/real-interruption/ (Sol review 9 P0)",
    "retractedOn": "2026-08-21",
    "whatIsRetracted": "Every causal claim this file was used to make about `m34cap`, and in particular docs/experiments/replan/README.md 12.3's attribution of the mixed-61 seed-1 move 162.846 -> 165.935 mm, and of the p50 32.64 s -> 25.91 s and the overruns 4-of-6 -> 2-of-6, to the cap.",
    "why": "At the HEAD this file documents, `m34cap` could not change a trajectory. `ScheduleSliceRun::advance` recorded a checkpoint and left `finished = false`, and its caller looped `while !slice.finished` to the end of the monolith (general_relaxed.rs:6861 at that HEAD), so the coordinator never regained control at a checkpoint. The cap could change the checkpoint *report* and nothing else.",
    "secondDefect": "The committed driver cannot generate the arms whose specs appear in this file. drivers/trancheq.py:44 parses any fraction other than `off` as `replan=1,planfirst=<value>`, so fraction \"capon\" would have produced `replan=1,planfirst=capon` and not the `replan=1,m34cap=1` recorded in every `spec` below. Source, driver and measured binary do not agree, which is a provenance break independent of the semantic one.",
    "replay": "docs/experiments/real-interruption/evidence/capreplay-30M.json, on a binary built from the committed base tree ea7c843: mixed-61, work=30000000, seeds 0/1/2, m34cap=0 against m34cap=1. Identical raw depth, identical incumbent fingerprint, identical total work, identical operator-call count and identical per-slice step digest on all three seeds; the whole document is equal once the scheduleSlice block is dropped, and unequal only because of the checkpoint list. Seed 1 is 171.3619986855876 mm at 28,636,653 units over 8 operator calls on both arms.",
    "whatSurvives": "The wall numbers themselves are real measurements of two processes; what does not survive is the attribution of the difference between them to `m34cap`. Two runs of one trajectory that differ by 6.7 s of p50 are a measurement of the box, and that round's own section 7 already records that the box was not quiet."
  },
